description: Playwright remotes off in CI; no tokens in traces
globs: e2e/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Playwright

- Keep remotes disabled in the CI webServer (`VITE_DISABLE_LOCAL_MFE_DIST=true`, empty remote URLs).
- Do not print tokens or storageState secrets in traces, logs, or screenshots.
- Federation contract tests are the only exception for enabling remotes.
